    "A successful job may be a skip/no-op or same-SHA redeployment",
    "Always distinguish MCP runtime S1 and applications on S1/S2",
    "Manual, config and database changes are not covered by GitHub workflow history",
    "Do not store private inventory, secrets, raw tokens or credentials in GitHub",
    "Do not create new deployment pipeline, dispatcher, queue or runtime authority",
    "Do not merge PR372, PR373 or PR374 without explicit owner approval"
